			],
			"Message": "docs(Output): Rewrite README for clarity and update badge labels\n\nRefresh the Output README to make the project's purpose and architecture more approachable for new contributors. Replace terse technical descriptions with plain-language explanations of how Output fits into the Land editor ecosystem — describing the role of esbuild and Rest pipelines, the plugin architecture in simpler terms, and why Node.js polyfills exist in a Tauri-based editor.\n\nSimplify badge labels (\"Last-commit\" → \"Update\", \"Issues\" → \"Issue\", \"Downloads\" → \"Download\") and fix the downloads badge URL to include the \"/total\" endpoint path for correct metric tracking.\n\nThe README now communicates Output's value proposition — deterministic builds across environments — without assuming deep prior context about the build system.",
			"SHA": "fe399795e3b6a10a35efa2b7ec9f9aa09be097e5"
